  "keyFeatures": [
    "Describe a level in plain text and have AI generate it directly in the Geometry Dash editor",
    "Live block placement — blocks appear in the editor while the AI is still working",
    "Support for 13 AI providers including Gemini, Claude, OpenAI, Mistral, DeepSeek, Groq, HuggingFace, OpenRouter, Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp, custom endpoints, and manual mode",
    "Free Platinum community cloud (volunteer Ollama servers) and fully local Ollama — no account required",
    "Session-based conversation memory that survives game restarts, with follow-up editing",
    "Two-pass generation: gameplay skeleton first, then decoration/color pass",
    "AI Copilot mode that watches for death zones and physics problems and proposes auto-fixes",
    "AI vision (level snapshots) for models that support images (Claude, Gemini, GPT-4o, LLaVA)",
    "Song analysis (BPM + waveform) to sync gameplay to the music",
    "Goal-setting with a self-managed task checklist and refinement-until-done mode",
    "Rating system and opt-in telemetry that feeds community model training",
    "Cross-platform: Windows, macOS, Android, iOS"
  ],
